        //   - f(x) = x^2 + x^1 + x^0
        // g(x) is given by the standard (p. 67)
        //   - g(x) = x^12 + x^11 + x^10 + x^9 + x^8 + x^5 + x^2 + 1
        // Multiply f(x) by x^(18 - 6)
